title KEYBOARD view, ZH layer composing "nihao": pinyin input and the candidate strip (ADR-024 FR-746)
view keyboard
caps off
unicode linux
lang_zh 1
zh 1
step tap_lang
step tap_key N
step tap_key I
step tap_key H
step tap_key A
step tap_key O
